{"ticker":"FE","updated":"2026-11-27T22:53:54Z","profile":{"longName":"FirstEnergy Corp.","shortName":"FirstEnergy Corp.","sector":"Utilities","industry":"Utilities - Regulated Electric","country":"United States","website":"https://www.firstenergycorp.com","fullTimeEmployees":11186,"marketCap":27704682496,"trailingPE":22.869566,"forwardPE":16.036531,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":1.7266864,"pegRatio":11.19,"targetMeanPrice":51.53571,"targetHighPrice":56.0,"targetLowPrice":46.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":14,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.099,"earningsGrowth":0.263,"grossMargins":0.69628996,"operatingMargins":0.21115999,"profitMargins":0.07485,"totalRevenue":16044999680,"beta":0.374,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":52.34,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":42.67,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":3.91},"summary":"FirstEnergy Corp., together with its subsidiaries, engages in the generation, distribution, and transmission of electricity in the United States. It operates through Distribution, Integrated, and Stand-Alone Transmission segments. The company owns and operates coal-fired, nuclear, hydroelectric, wind, and solar power generating facilities. The company operates 252,959 distribution line miles and 24,157 transmission line miles, including overhead pole line and underground conduit carrying primary, secondary, and street lighting circuits. The company serves customers in Ohio, Pennsylvania, New Jersey, West Virginia, Maryland, and New York. FirstEnergy Corp. was incorporated in 1996 and is headquartered in Akron, Ohio.","summary_zh":"FirstEnergy Corp. 及其子公司在美國從事發電、配電和輸電業務。它透過配電、綜合和獨立傳輸部門運作。該公司擁有並經營燃煤、核電、水力發電、風能和太陽能發電設施。該公司營運 252,959 英里的配電線路和 24,157 英里的輸電線路，包括架空桿線和承載初級、次級和街道照明電路的地下管道。該公司為俄亥俄州、賓夕法尼亞州、新澤西州、西維吉尼亞州、馬裡蘭州和紐約州的客戶提供服務。 FirstEnergy Corp. 成立於 1996 年，總部位於俄亥俄州阿克倫。","sector_zh":"公用事業","industry_zh":"公用事業 - 受監管的電力","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-29","o":45.16,"h":45.46,"l":44.66,"c":45.41,"v":5956600},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":45.4,"h":46.13,"l":45.37,"c